  ○ [p1_t1] Backend - FastAPI + SQLite CRUD
    agent:  Backend Developer (programmer_1)
    desc:   Create the backend for a Markdown notes app at /Users/shenweizhang/Desktop/ai/test/

1. Create Python virtual environment:
   cd /Users/shenweizhang/Desktop/ai/test/ && python3 -m venv venv

2. Create backend/ directory, then requirements.txt:
   fastapi==0.115.0
   uvicorn==0.30.6
   sqlalchemy==2.0.35
   pydantic==2.9.2
   python-multipart==0.0.12

3. Create backend/main.py with:
   - FastAPI app with CORS (allow all origins for dev)
   - SQLite database via SQLAlchemy
   - Notes table: id (int PK), title (str), content (str, stores BlockNote JSON as text), created_at (datetime), updated_at (datetime)
   - CRUD endpoints:
     GET /api/notes - list all notes (id, title, updated_at)
     POST /api/notes - create note (accepts {title, content})
     GET /api/notes/{id} - get single note
     PUT /api/notes/{id} - update note (accepts {title, content})
     DELETE /api/notes/{id} - delete note
   - Add /api/health endpoint

4. Create backend/database.py with SQLAlchemy setup

5. Create backend/schemas.py with Pydantic models (NoteCreate, NoteUpdate, NoteResponse)

6. Install dependencies: cd /Users/shenweizhang/Desktop/ai/test/ && source venv/bin/activate && pip install -r backend/requirements.txt

Make sure the backend can run standalone with: source venv/bin/activate && uvicorn backend.main:app --reload --port 8000
  ○ [p2_t1] Frontend - Next.js + BlockNote + Shadcn
    agent:  Frontend Developer (programmer_2)
    desc:   Create the Next.js frontend for a Markdown notes app at /Users/shenweizhang/Desktop/ai/test/

1. Bootstrap Next.js App Router project:
   cd /Users/shenweizhang/Desktop/ai/test/ && npx create-next-app@latest frontend --typescript --tailwind --eslint --app --src-dir --no-import-alias --use-npm
   (If create-next-app fails, manually create the project structure)

2. Install dependencies:
   cd /Users/shenweizhang/Desktop/ai/test/frontend && npm install @blocknote/core @blocknote/react @blocknote/mantine @radix-ui/react-dialog @radix-ui/react-slot class-variance-authority clsx tailwind-merge lucide-react

3. Initialize Shadcn UI:
   cd /Users/shenweizhang/Desktop/ai/test/frontend && npx shadcn@latest init -d --force
   Then install components: npx shadcn@latest add button dialog input textarea scroll-area card -y

4. Create the app structure:

   src/app/layout.tsx - Root layout with:
   - Shadcn Button, Card, ScrollArea imports
   - Basic CSS (globals.css with tailwind)
   - Sidebar layout structure

   src/app/page.tsx - Main page with:
   - Left sidebar (notes list from API)
   - Right panel (BlockNote editor)
   - "New Note" button at top of sidebar
   - Click note to load it in editor
   - Auto-save on content change (debounced ~1s)

   src/app/api-utils.ts - API functions:
   - fetchNotes(), fetchNote(id), createNote(), updateNote(id), deleteNote(id)
   - Base URL: http://localhost:8000/api

   src/app/components/NoteList.tsx - Sidebar component:
   - List notes from GET /api/notes
   - Click to select, delete button per item
   - Selected note highlighted

   src/app/components/Editor.tsx - BlockNote editor wrapper:
   - Use @blocknote/react's useCreateBlockNote hook
   - Load content from current note
   - onChange saves to backend (debounced)
   - Display title input above editor

   src/app/globals.css - Tailwind CSS with:
   @tailwind base;
   @tailwind components;
   @tailwind utilities;
   import '@blocknote/core/fonts/inter.css';
   import '@blocknote/mantine/style.css';

5. Make sure package.json includes all deps and the project builds with 'npm run dev'

The frontend should:
- Fetch notes list from http://localhost:8000/api/notes
- Allow creating new notes
- Allow editing title and content (BlockNote)
- Auto-save changes
- Allow deleting notes
- Show the selected note highlighted in the sidebar
