## ✅ Markdown Notes App — Complete

### Project: `/Users/shenweizhang/Desktop/ai/test/`

### Backend (FastAPI + SQLite)

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `backend/requirements.txt` | Python deps (fastapi, uvicorn, sqlalchemy, pydantic, python-multipart) |
| `backend/database.py` | SQLAlchemy engine + session + `get_db` dependency |
| `backend/schemas.py` | Pydantic models: `NoteCreate`, `NoteUpdate`, `NoteResponse`, `NoteListItem` |
| `backend/main.py` | FastAPI app with CORS, SQLAlchemy `Note` model, all CRUD endpoints |
| `venv/` | Python virtual environment (dependencies installed) |

**API Endpoints:**
- `GET  /api/health` — health check
- `GET  /api/notes` — list notes (id, title, updated_at)
- `POST /api/notes` — create note (title, content)
- `GET  /api/notes/{id}` — get single note with full content
- `PUT  /api/notes/{id}` — update note (partial update supported)
- `DELETE /api/notes/{id}` — delete note

**Run:** `source venv/bin/activate && uvicorn backend.main:app --reload --port 8000`

### Frontend (Next.js + BlockNote + Shadcn)

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `frontend/src/app/page.tsx` | Main page — sidebar + editor layout, state management |
| `frontend/src/app/layout.tsx` | Root layout |
| `frontend/src/app/globals.css` | Tailwind v4 + CSS variables + BlockNote styles |
| `frontend/src/app/api-utils.ts` | API client (`fetchNotes`, `createNote`, `updateNote`, `deleteNote`) |
| `frontend/src/app/components/NoteList.tsx` | Sidebar — note list, selection highlight, delete button |
| `frontend/src/app/components/Editor.tsx` | BlockNote editor + title input + debounced auto-save (1s) |
| `frontend/src/components/ui/*` | Shadcn UI components (button, card, dialog, input, scroll-area, textarea) |
| `frontend/src/lib/utils.ts` | `cn()` utility for class merging |

**Features:**
- Fetches notes from `http://localhost:8000/api/notes`
- Create new notes (auto-selects and opens)
- BlockNote rich text editing
- Title editing with input
- Debounced auto-save (~1s after last change)
- Delete notes with confirmation on hover
- Selected note highlighted in sidebar

**Run:** `cd frontend && npm run dev` (verified working — starts on port 3000)

### How to Use

```bash
# Terminal 1 — Backend
cd /Users/shenweizhang/Desktop/ai/test/
source venv/bin/activate
uvicorn backend.main:app --reload --port 8000

# Terminal 2 — Frontend
cd /Users/shenweizhang/Desktop/ai/test/frontend
npm run dev
```

Open `http://localhost:3000` — create, edit, and delete notes with BlockNote rich text editing, all persisted to SQLite.
